  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prototyping A Center of Competency for Digital and AI Skilling for the Public Sector.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to boost Kenyas digital transformation by establishing a Center of Competency in partnership with the UNDP, the Government of Kenya, and Microsoft. The centre will serve as a hub to enhance digital ecosystems, foster partnerships, and improve government capabilities in utilizing technologies like AI, cybersecurity, and data science. Key outputs include: 1) Enhanced digital competencies within the public sector to accelerate digital transformation in Kenya. 2) Increased access</narrative>
  </description>
